# Generated viewer-under-test for the Playwright harness -- all the
# _gen_harness_viewer fixture dirs (_viewer, _viewer_path, _viewer_lin,
# _viewer_nolin, _viewer_step, _viewer_intro, _viewer_intronone, plus any
# future task adds). The glob is dir-anchored (trailing /) so it never
# matches tracked files like tests/manual/keyframe-editor.html.
# (re-build via `python -m splatpipe.viewers.spark._gen_harness_viewer`)
tests/manual/_viewer*/
